OL,3,GNEWSAFormer leader convicted of fraud
OL,4,Aquits as councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former leader of Ashfield District
OL,7,FCouncil ` who was convicted of fraud
OL,8,Fand tax evasion ` has stepped down from
OL,9,Fhis role as a councillor, the authority
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FJason Zadrozny was found guilty of nine
OL,13,Fcounts of fraud and four counts of tax
OL,14,Fevasion in September.
OL,16,FHe is due to be sentenced on 27
OL,17,FNovember and was told he was "at risk
OL,18,Fof an immediate custodial sentence".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
