OL,3,GNEWSAFormer leader convicted of fraud
OL,4,Aquits as councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FAshfield District Council confirmed on
OL,7,FThursday that Zadrozny had resigned as
OL,8,Fcouncillor for Larwood, adding there
OL,9,Fwould be no by-election until the local
OL,10,Felections in May.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
